==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Dusknoir|40}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion, as was its '''Shadow Void''' {{TCG|Ability}}.
*'''Devour Soul''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Dusknoir|62}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

